OL,3,ACOP31 climate talks end with no major
OL,4,Adeal after fossil fuels row derails
OL,5,Ahopes of agreement
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe COP31 climate summit in Turkey has
OL,8,Fformally come to an end after countries
OL,9,Ffailed to agree a deal - we'll bring
OL,10,Fyou the latest analysis and reaction
OL,11,Fyou the latest updates and analysis
OL,12,Fhere
OL,14,FThe EU and some other countries
OL,15,Frejected a fourth and final draft
OL,16,Fagreement over its failure to mention a
OL,17,Fneed to phase out fossil fuels, the
OL,18,Flargest driver of global climate change
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/4
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
