OL,3,ACOP31 climate talks end with no major
OL,4,Adeal after fossil fuels row derails
OL,5,Ahopes of agreement
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn EU representative accuses some oil
OL,8,Fstates of hijacking talks, while Russia
OL,9,Fdefended opposing the inclusion of such
OL,10,Fa commitment and levelled direct
OL,11,Fcriticism of the EU in its speech
OL,13,FThe talks have been the longest-running
OL,14,Fin the summit's history, with
OL,15,Fnegotiations breaking down two days
OL,16,Fafter they had been due to end - here's
OL,17,Fa timeline of how we got here
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/4
